<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Scaling Results</div>
<h2>Cola DLM Surpasses AR and LLaDA at Scale</h2>
<p>The scaling comparison pits Cola DLM against strictly matched 2B-parameter AR (LLaMA) and LLaDA baselines, using the same tokenizer, training data, and compute budget. All models are evaluated under a unified few-shot <em>generative</em> protocol — no likelihood-based classification.</p>
<p>The headline result: across 8 benchmarks up to ~2000 EFLOPs, <strong>Cola DLM's Task Average curve climbs most persistently and reaches the best final performance</strong>. The advantage is especially clear on reasoning-intensive tasks where global semantic organization matters most.</p>

